1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:00,970
Good morning, everybody.

2
00:00:01,950 --> 00:00:09,010
Last night was the annual general meeting of our shareholders, and the topic of discussion was about the future of this enterprise.

3
00:00:10,130 --> 00:00:12,630
As you know, our profits have fallen dramatically.

4
00:00:13,675 --> 00:00:18,350
However, the good news is that nobody doubts that the company can be turned around.

5
00:00:19,445 --> 00:00:24,650
The meeting decided on a course of action aimed at reducing costs and increasing sales.

6
00:00:25,270 --> 00:00:31,790
In order to achieve this, a team of consultants will be visiting the company's operations over the next five days.

7
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:35,670
They will then write a report recommending specific actions.

8
00:00:36,530 --> 00:00:38,590
We trust that you will give them your full cooperation.

9
00:00:39,690 --> 00:00:40,010
Thank You.
